    "description": "Glo Skin Beauty / Glo Minerals\n10 Piece Professional Makeup Lot\nMade in USA / Germany\nComprehensive collection of Glo Skin Beauty (formerly Glo Minerals) professional-grade cosmetics. This lot features a variety of base products, eye colors, and brow powder. Known for mineral-based formulas, Glo Skin Beauty products are designed for high-performance coverage with skin-nourishing ingredients. The set includes a mix of older \"Glo Minerals\" branding and updated \"Glo Skin Beauty\" packaging.\nSatin Cream Foundation (40ml tube)\nLuxe Liquid Foundation (30ml bottle)\nLuminous Liquid Foundation SPF 18 (30ml bottle)\nPressed Base Compact (9g) - Shade: Natural Light\nOil Free Camouflage (3.1g) - Shade: Beige\nBrow Powder Duo (1.1g) - Shade: Blonde\n2 Single Eye Shadows (1.4g each) - Shades: Cosmic & Locket\n2 Cream Stay Shadow Sticks (1.4g each) - Shades: Bonbon & Scotch\nCondition:\nMixed condition lot. Most items are open-box and show signs of light testing or moderate use. The Pressed Base compact shows visible usage with staining on the application puff. Liquid foundations and cream sticks appear to have been opened. Original retail boxes are included for 8 of the 10 items; the two single eye shadow pots do not have boxes. Packaging shows minor shelf wear.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged 